Data & Attribution Notice:
The structured supplementary evidence tables (`data/S1`–`S4`) accompany:
J. Bai, Z. Cai, R. Yang, K. Lekadir, and S. Li, "A review of Kolmogorov–Arnold networks
for medical image analysis," Computerized Medical Imaging and Graphics, vol. 136, 102827, 2026.
